helper wich recursively generate an xlwt easy style string
for example:

  hstyle = {"font": {"bold": True},
  "border": {"top": "thin",
            "right": "thin",
            "bottom": "thin",
            "left": "thin"},
  "align": {"horiz": "center"}}
